/// expensive to do for every build.␀␀À-À.À:À;Àn‚.À␀␀À“&À°␀␀ÀnÀoÀ␀*À␀+ÀH…JÀƒ'/// A widget that has a child widget provided to it, instead of building a new
/// widget.
///
/// Useful as a base class for other widgets, such as [InheritedWidget] and
